OL,3,GNEWSACould the status of Lancashire's
OL,4,Atwo cities be at risk?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs Lancashire waits to hear what the
OL,7,Ffuture of local government will look
OL,8,Flike, questions have been raised over
OL,9,Fwhether the county's two cities could
OL,10,Flose their status.
OL,12,FPreston and Lancaster are Lancashire's
OL,13,Fonly cities, having gained the
OL,14,Fdesignation at different points in
OL,15,Ftheir history.
OL,17,FLancaster was the first, and although
OL,18,Fit received its original charter in
OL,19,F1193, it was formally granted city
OL,20,Fstatus in 1937.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
