OL,3,GNEWSACould the status of Lancashire's
OL,4,Atwo cities be at risk?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreston became a city much later, after
OL,7,Fbeing awarded the status by Queen
OL,8,FElizabeth II as part of her Golden
OL,9,FJubilee celebrations in 2002.
